      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining the Python Script**\n\nI'm now focusing on creating the Python script, `extract_tables.py`, to extract table data. The core will use Google Cloud Document AI as the external provider. I'm building a plan to ensure clear identification of the external dependency within the code, making the design explicit.\n\n\n**Constructing the Extraction Script**\n\nI'm now outlining the steps to build `extract_tables.py`, focusing on integration with Google Cloud Document AI. The plan includes importing the Document AI SDK and crafting a function for table extraction, taking project ID, location, processor ID, and document path as parameters. This function will use the Document AI client for document processing and table parsing. I am writing the file using the `write` tool.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789862288284,
          "start": 1789862284382
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc1b0c5e001ewGZ2GCpK5K9VG",
