      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining the Scope**\n\nI'm currently focused on pinpointing a suitable external provider for layout extraction within the Python script, `extract_layout.py`. My focus is zeroing in on an external library or API that can handle the layout analysis, particularly identifying blocks, lines, and tables. I'm prioritizing clarity in how the external service's usage will be flagged in the code.\n\n\n**Pinpointing the Provider**\n\nI've decided to proceed with Google Cloud Document AI as the external provider, given its robust features for document parsing. I'm moving forward with coding `extract_layout.py`, focusing on clear integration of the Document AI client library, specifically `google.cloud.documentai`. The code will include setup for client credentials and a core function for processing documents and extracting layout data. The script will be ready to go once these are in place.\n\n\n",
